# Server-side diagnostic and deployment scripts, plus the SSH known-hosts file.
# The scripts carry the live host address and one-off repairs; the known-hosts file
# is machine-specific. Neither belongs in the repository.
.ssh-local/

# Database files. They hold live family data and change on every local run, so a
# committed copy is a stale, machine-specific artefact rather than source.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Screenshots taken while checking behaviour on a phone. They are evidence for a
# conversation, not part of the product, and they add megabytes per check.
/qa/

